      "message": "Frank: you asked:\n\u003e isnt ARGBToNV21 the same as ABGRToNV12 which you can achieve with constants?\n\nThe `ARGBToNV21Matrix()` function already exists. This CL merely exports it as a public API function.\n\nNote that `ARGBToNV21Matrix()` is not implemented as a call to `ARGBToNVqwMatrix()` with constants as you suggested.\n\nWould you like me to mark `ARGBToNV21Matrix()` as static instead?",
      "revId": "77b57efa1120078a3d44ffbb7b13d9fa9ea89b2c",
